@startuml FintechSequenceLoginToDashboard

title User Login → Data Load → Dashboard Render

actor User
participant "React App" as App
participant "AuthContext" as Auth
participant "API Client" as API
participant "FastAPI Backend" as BE
participant "DataContext" as Data
participant "Accounts Service (FE)" as AccSvc
participant "Transactions Service (FE)" as TxSvc
participant "Analytics Service (FE)" as AnSvc

User -> App : Enter credentials
App -> Auth : login(email, password)

Auth -> API : POST /auth/login
API -> BE : /auth/login
BE --> API : access_token, user_id
API --> Auth : token + user_id

Auth -> Auth : store token (localStorage)
Auth -> API : set Authorization header

Auth -> Data : trigger initial load

Data -> AccSvc : loadAccounts(user_id)
AccSvc -> API : GET /accounts/user/{id}
API -> BE : /accounts/user/{id}
BE --> API : accounts[]
API --> AccSvc : accounts[]
AccSvc --> Data : setAccounts()

Data -> TxSvc : loadTransactions(user_id)
TxSvc -> API : GET /transactions/user/{id}
API -> BE : /transactions/user/{id}
BE --> API : transactions[]
API --> TxSvc : transactions[]
TxSvc --> Data : setTransactions()

Data -> AnSvc : loadAnalytics(user_id)
AnSvc -> API : GET /analytics/*
API -> BE : /analytics/*
BE --> API : analytics payload
API --> AnSvc : analytics
AnSvc --> Data : setAnalytics()

Data --> App : state ready
App --> User : Render Dashboard

@enduml